# TAKEN-NOT: isInBounds
# TAKEN: GetArrayElement
# RUN(LIED): walk f1:Body mechanisms=all testing=IgnoreLengthStores
# LIED: SetArrayLength
# LIED: GetArrayElement {{*}}isInBounds
